WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,040
Still a large area has been purified

2
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,700
This is still within the scope of what we can handle.

3
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,750
A large group of mourners came from the city

4
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,310
He has already gone to our other place to go to the east gate.

5
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,940
What should we do now?

6
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:42,980
You lead others to resist first

7
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,060
Women and children all go

8
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,060
I'll pack my things

9
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:46,180
Buy me some time

10
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,100
let us run away
